{"id":"40041a5a5d6a4573","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-creative-set.md","title":"Creative Set","display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-creative-set","aliases":["90-df-creative-set"],"display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-ce-set]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-creative-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-creative-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-creative-set — Creative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"548e36d75578d019\" href=\"?note=548e36d75578d019\" title=\"90-df-ce-set\">90-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>；固定编号满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\\)</span>，依据为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>，不是另一套任意有效列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (集合)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(C)\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"548e36d75578d019\" href=\"?note=548e36d75578d019\" title=\"90-df-ce-set\">90-df-ce-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (c.e. 集的固定有效枚举)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> (一元全递归函数类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CE}(C)\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus C\n\\rightarrow p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus C)\\setminus W_e\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CE}(C)\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus C\n\\rightarrow p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus C)\\setminus W_e\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}(C)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>是创造集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> : 第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>个c.e.集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{C}\">\\(\\bar{C}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>的补集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(e)\">\\(p(e)\\)</span> : 有效地从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{C}\">\\(\\bar{C}\\)</span>中&quot;创造&quot;新元素</li>\n<li>创造集都是非递归的；这里的生产函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是一元全递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"548e36d75578d019","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering",